The '''Grim Batol Memorial''' is a monument to the fallen [[Wildhammer dwarves]] of [[Grim Batol]] erected on a cliff overlooking the [[Ruins of Stolgaz Keep]] in the [[Grim Reaches]].

==Text==
{{Book||align=left|content=
A shrine dedicated to those that fought, and gave their lives in the defense of innocents against our greatest of challenges. May this shrine forever honor those that died within our once great halls in defiance against our invaders.

You shall never be forgotten, brave warriors of Grim Batol.}}

